⚙️ Section A2 – Control Panel & Latching Relay

Objective: Assemble the front‑panel controls and safety interlock loop.

Components

Front panel (from DXF)

ON/OFF toggle switch

START momentary pushbutton

SERVO brake potentiometer (knob)

E‑STOP mushroom switch (latching)

12 V RESET button

LCD display module

Latching relay (40 A contacts, 12 V coil)


Assembly Steps

1. Fabricate panel per DXF template; deburr holes.


2. Install switches & buttons; secure with locking nuts (hand‑tight + ¼ turn).


3. Mount LCD with M3 × 8 mm screws and nylon spacers.


4. Wire E‑STOP Loop: E‑STOP → MCU_OK → LATCH coil − (series). Coil + from DC bus via fuse.


5. Wire ON/OFF toggle to MCU enable (5 V).


6. Connect START to MCU start input (via debounce RC network).


7. Run shielded cable from brake pot to MCU ADC input.


8. Verify orientation before mounting panel.


9. Secure latching relay on DIN rail near bus bars; connect contacts to main drive feed.




